# Machine 1: L = { aⁿbᵐ | m ≥ n, n > 0 }
#
# Each round pairs the first free a with the first free b by marking them as
# X and Y. Once no free a remains, the machine checks that the suffix contains
# only Y and b.
#
# q0  marks the next a, or enters the final check when it reaches Y because
#     all the a are marked. An initial b or blank stops the machine because
#     n = 0.
# q1  searches right for the first free b and marks it as Y. If it reaches a
#     blank first, the machine stops because m < n.
# q2  goes back left to the last X.
# q3  checks that only Y and b remain before the blank, stopping the machine
#     if it finds an a.
# q4  accepts.

# Q
q0 q1 q2 q3 q4
# Σ
a b
# Γ
a b X Y _
# q0
q0
# b
_
# F
q4
# number of tapes
1
# δ: from read to write move
q0 a q1 X R
q0 Y q3 Y R
q1 a q1 a R
q1 Y q1 Y R
q1 b q2 Y L
q2 a q2 a L
q2 Y q2 Y L
q2 X q0 X R
q3 Y q3 Y R
q3 b q3 b R
q3 _ q4 _ S
